-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §145 העסקה בתנאי הרפורמה: from תשס"ט, an
-- intern in teaching is employed only under the reform.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `145 העסקה בתנאי הרפורמה`

@ref akn:art_145
GIVEN `year starts` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an intern is employed only under the reform in the year starting` `year starts` IF
    `year starts` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2008)

#ASSERT `an intern is employed only under the reform in the year starting` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2008)
#ASSERT NOT `an intern is employed only under the reform in the year starting` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2007)
